{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771510/extras/60c390e113e74ee25414c7f3d0380aa8.avif?t=1770360792\" width=600 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is year 256 of Shartemen. You are a champion of the Pilgrims, answering your mentor's call to arms against the marching Naga Cult. You and your unlikely friend will be sent into many battles against all sorts of foes, but the end goal is clear: Hunt down the Naga Cult's current masterminds. How are you going to win this struggle?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771510/extras/110062d2fccdc69a99c934a3805d7f8f.poster.avif?t=1770360792\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771510/extras/110062d2fccdc69a99c934a3805d7f8f.webm?t=1770360792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771510/extras/110062d2fccdc69a99c934a3805d7f8f.mp4?t=1770360792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple <strong>2D ISOMETRIC HACK'N'SLASH\u00a0</strong>game made in Construct 2 where you play as the best... or the worst, of your people.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOSS FIGHTS ARE THE FOCUS</strong>: Not only the game respects your life's time, it can also be an interesting challenge for those who love speedrunning or doing deathless/hitless playthroughs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE GOAL IS TO WIN</strong> your fights, <strong>NOT NECESSARILY TO EXTERMINATE</strong> your targets. Some of your own people may appreciate acts of mercy towards deserving foes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771510/extras/f40000a83db1ff44e47291e58ec988d2.poster.avif?t=1770360792\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771510/extras/f40000a83db1ff44e47291e58ec988d2.webm?t=1770360792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771510/extras/f40000a83db1ff44e47291e58ec988d2.mp4?t=1770360792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As fighters, each of you will be armed with <strong><i>3 TYPES OF WEAPONS!</i></strong> Fight smart!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start the game with just THE TWO of you, but you might MEET MORE on your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have 2 XBOX GAMEPADS? Grab a friend with you for <strong><i>CO-OP GAMEPLAY!</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ BOSSES to fight in this war, and YOU CHOOSE WHO to fight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need more EQUIPMENT? See what you can CRAFT or BUY from your people and allies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to your <strong><i>RENOWN</i></strong> and <strong><i>WEEK COUNT!</i></strong>\u00a0Those who hate war will seek to end it quickly, but those who enjoy war will only seek to prolong it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DECIDE</i></strong>\u00a0once you win the fight: Will you TAKE DOWN your foe, or LET THEM LIVE? You might get rewarded more for picking one over the other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets to discover!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to figure out all the ways to end the campaign against the Naga Cult!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtracks, carefully crafted to depict a fantasy world set in bronze age era where magic is as common as breathing and everything develops around the fact.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RECOMMENDED : Xbox or similar gamepad</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771510/extras/d44d6531d8c8c40a44b3d3b165bbf60b.poster.avif?t=1770360792\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771510/extras/d44d6531d8c8c40a44b3d3b165bbf60b.webm?t=1770360792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771510/extras/d44d6531d8c8c40a44b3d3b165bbf60b.mp4?t=1770360792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEVELOPER UPDATES -- July 27th, 2025</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(DEMO / Implemented / Planned) Contents of the full version :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 / 2 / 3 Story paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 / 22 / 34 boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >0 / 1 / 4 Coop exclusive tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >0 / 1 / 4 Solo exclusive tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 / 6 / 10 Shop items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 / 5 / 5 Crafting items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X / X / Autosave feature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O / O / NPC banter reflecting on story choices and progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X / X / Environmental hazards for outdoor and indoor areas during boss fights</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771510?t=1770360792","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771510/b947d21b99407e8a8bd8760d1f6761f9f6